@template warm

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- Oh, {nick}, you missed your shift. Are you eating? Sleeping? Tell me.

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- Come here. The Chief was fair, wasn't she? And I'm on your side. Always.   #warm

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- Oh, love. The ready room. Sit with me a minute. Then early to bed, yes?   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- I'm worried sick. Go tomorrow. Please. For me, if not for you.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- There. Look at you. I knew you would.   #warm

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- Tomorrow. Oh dear. I'm going to cry, and you're not to mind.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Look after yourself. Eat properly. And write, or I'll worry.   #warm
